      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "A. An observation records; a hypothesis\nis testable.\nB. An observation is a confirmed\nhypothesis.\nC. They are independent of each other.\nD. A hypothesis is only a final\nconclusion.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A. An observation records; a hypothesis\nis testable.\nB. An observation is a confirmed\nhypothesis.\nC. They are independent of each other.\nD. A hypothesis is only a final\nconclusion.",
